{"title":"2002 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><dl><dd><i>The following problem is from the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B Problems\">2002 AMC 12B #3</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10B_Problems\" title=\"2002 AMC 10B Problems\">2002 AMC 10B #6</a>, so those problems redirect to this page.</i></dd></dl>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>For how many positive integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/4/0/e401dcfd066660187824a483c4625ce4905c2e41.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n^2 - 3n + 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"91\" height=\"16\" /> a <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Prime\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Prime\">prime</a> number?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/7/5a704203a7b5598744c0e3c55c2995b7fcec5b0c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A)}\\ \\text{none} \\qquad\\mathrm{(B)}\\ \\text{one} \\qquad\\mathrm{(C)}\\ \\text{two} \\qquad\\mathrm{(D)}\\ \\text{more\\ than\\ two,\\ but\\ finitely\\ many} \\qquad\\mathrm{(E)}\\ \\text{infinitely\\ many}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"733\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Factoring, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/0/9/709829c03830ade4a292082d0a741acbe49bc904.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n^2 - 3n + 2 = (n-2)(n-1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"227\" height=\"19\" />. Either <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/d/4bdca93962a2beaffc172ca394e04fe05bd74ffd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"44\" height=\"15\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/9/ef9b02e32cfba0db0f9038a8d077596720f62e91.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n-2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"44\" height=\"15\" /> is odd, and the other is even.  Their product must yield an even number.  The only prime that is even is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, which is when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> is not a positive number, the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/e/f/7efba8d8079289db6e71786896985ea693868105.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\mathrm{(B)}\\ \\text{one}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"69\" height=\"29\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Considering parity, we see that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/4/0/e401dcfd066660187824a483c4625ce4905c2e41.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n^2 - 3n + 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"91\" height=\"16\" /> is always even.  The only even prime is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, and so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/a/c/4ac4a29feb2a98306789bca28e8b53192c821d07.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n^2-3n=0$\" width=\"93\" height=\"15\" /> whence <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/5/50542a37dc4f9ac84c6626de257f16bb6476340e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=3\\Rightarrow\\boxed{\\mathrm{(B)}\\ \\text{one}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"141\" height=\"29\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10B\" title=\"2002 AMC 10B\">2002 AMC 10B</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10B_Problems\" title=\"2002 AMC 10B Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10B_Answer_Key\" title=\"2002 AMC 10B Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2002 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_7\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2002 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 7\">Problem 7</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2002 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2002 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_3\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2002 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_4\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2002 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2002 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_6\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2002 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_7\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2002 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_8\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2002 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2002 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_10\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2002 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_11\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2002 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2002 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2002 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2002 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_15\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2002 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_16\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2002 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"2002 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_18\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2002 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"2002 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"2002 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_21\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2002 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_22\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2002 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"2002 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"2002 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"2002 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 25\">25</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AMC_10_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AMC 10 Problems and Solutions\"> All AMC 10 Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B\">2002 AMC 12B</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Answer_Key\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 25\">25</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AMC_12_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AMC 12 Problems and Solutions\"> All AMC 12 Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div>\n<p>Usage of the Prime Number 2\nNote that two is the only even prime number. \nSo, in order for this expression to result in a prime number, the result must be 2.\nYou can factor the quadratic equation and eventually see that 3 is the only number satisfying this condition.\nHence, the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/2/c72a08c9de59fb963e17912f4b2127a20340346a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\mathrm{(B)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"38\" height=\"29\" />.\n</p></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261016231625\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.048 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.074 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 268/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 4448/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 395/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 3232/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   28.544      1 -total\n 26.98%    7.702      1 Template:AMC10_box\n 26.05%    7.436      1 Template:AMC12_box\n 19.24%    5.491      1 Template:Duplicate\n 16.86%    4.813      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:6305:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261016231625 and revision id 286585. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}